msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-06700000"
msgid ""
"RHW Flexible Underpass (FLUPs) Portal [FLEX-based] - Supports RHW-2/URoad-2, RHW-3/URoad-3, RHW-4/URoad-4, MIS/URamp, RHW-6S/URoad-6S\n"
"\n"
"Use URoad Starters for underground portion"
msgstr ""
"RHW柔性地下通道 (FLUPs) 门户[基于FLEX] - 支持RHW-2/URoad-2、RHW-3/URoad-3、RHW-4/URoad-4、MIS/URamp、RHW-6S/URoad-6S\n"
"\n"
"地下部分请使用URoad起始模块"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-06700001"
