"Road Flexible Underpass (FLUPs) Portal [FLEX-based]\n"
"\n"
"Use URoad-2 Starter for underground portion."
msgstr ""
"公路柔性地下通道 (FLUPs) 门户[基于FLEX]\n"
"\n"
"地下部分使用URoad-2起始模块。"

msgctxt "2026960B-2A592FD1-06700002"
