"One-Way Road (OWR) Flexible Underpass (FLUPs) Portal [FLEX-based]\n"
"\n"
"Use URoad-4 Starter for underground portion."
msgstr ""
"单行道 (OWR) 柔性地下通道 (FLUPs) 门户[基于FLEX]\n"
"\n"
